{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-listing-page-js","path":"/projects/","result":{"data":{"kontentItemListingPage":{"elements":{"primary_text":{"value":"Projects"},"secondary_text":{"value":"Projects I have been working on...\n\nThis covers various disciplines and applications. Projects range from experimental prototypes to polished dev tools. The goal is to gather my personal library with samples, reusable components, and functional tools in one place. This centralized hub aims to showcase my work and inspire collaboration and innovation among developers globally."},"hero_image":{"value":[{"name":"DshZL_dUwAEior0.jpg","url":"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/6aec6c2a-3010-01c9-8295-4d988333f15d/949b42fe-b821-43ac-86c1-f0ab585d60f7/DshZL_dUwAEior0.jpg","width":1080,"height":1440,"description":null}]},"listing_page_options__list_types":{"value":"[{\"id\":\"dee938e8-aab2-411c-a701-7d7f93c8c7a7\",\"name\":\"Project\",\"codename\":\"project\",\"last_modified\":\"2021-02-20T12:17:28.0840356Z\"}]"}}},"allKontentItem":{"nodes":[{"__typename":"kontent_item_project","system":{"id":"0887625d-eb03-583f-9fd6-9eb9ab204e38","codename":"apollo_express_boilerplate_utilizing_headless_cms"},"elements":{"title":{"value":"Apollo Express Kontent boilerplate"},"url_slug":{"value":"apollo-express-kontent-boilerplate"},"release_date":{"value":"2018-12-12T00:00:00Z"},"image":{"value":[{"url":"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/6aec6c2a-3010-01c9-8295-4d988333f15d/bd3421f9-ef53-48d7-9d61-eab2eddd8e42/schema.png"}]},"summary":{"value":"<p>This boilerplate showcasing how to combine the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nodejs.org/en/\">Node.js</a>&nbsp;web server <a href=\"https://expressjs.com/\">Express.js</a>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<a href=\"https://graphql.org/\">GraphQL</a>. The server converts the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.kontent.ai/reference/kentico-kontent-apis-overview\">Kentico Kontent Delivery REST API</a>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://graphql.org/\">GraphQL</a>&nbsp;using the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.apollographql.com/\">Apollo framework</a>&nbsp;and then renders the output using the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://pugjs.org/\">Pug view engine</a>.</p>"},"channel_purpose":{"value":[{"codename":"website"}]},"listing_category":{"value":[]}}},{"__typename":"kontent_item_project","system":{"id":"dc8349b4-2049-49fd-b4d3-d199e99f2db0","codename":"ckeditor_weekend_video_series"},"elements":{"title":{"value":"CKEditor weekend video series"},"url_slug":{"value":"ckeditor-weekend-video-series"},"release_date":{"value":"2025-05-25T22:00:00Z"},"image":{"value":[{"url":"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/6aec6c2a-3010-01c9-8295-4d988333f15d/05ba2861-3588-42c8-ae96-cb63bee4a1c7/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%209%2C%202025%2C%2011_47_32%20AM.png"}]},"summary":{"value":"<p>I started with <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Simply007-cz\" data-new-window=\"true\" title=\"Youtube @Simply007-cz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">my personal YouTube channe</a>l, where I shared a typical coding videos. In this series, I vibe-coded a clone of the Google Keep app, showcasing how to build a notes application from scratch. The second part focused on enhancing the app by integrating CKEditor for rich-text editing, making it a powerful tool for managing notes. Finally, I demonstrated the inclusion of CKEditor's real-time collaboration features, allowing multiple users to edit notes simultaneously and view revision histories.</p>"},"channel_purpose":{"value":[{"codename":"website"}]},"listing_category":{"value":[{"name":"Web","codename":"web"},{"name":"Video","codename":"video"},{"name":"JS/TS","codename":"js_ts"}]}}},{"__typename":"kontent_item_project","system":{"id":"71559e30-3e6a-517f-8bab-85610100f61d","codename":"element_gallery"},"elements":{"title":{"value":"Custom element gallery"},"url_slug":{"value":"custom-element-gallery"},"release_date":{"value":"2021-02-28T23:00:00Z"},"image":{"value":[{"url":"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com