Statiq</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://kontent.ai/\">Kentico Kontent</a>&nbsp;via&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/alanta/Kontent.Statiq\">Kontent.Statiq</a>&nbsp;module to evangelize the Jamstack world for .NET developers.</p>"},"channel_purpose":{"value":[{"codename":"website"}]},"listing_category":{"value":[]}}},{"__typename":"kontent_item_project","system":{"id":"1a355f95-b865-508c-9d4e-aed86572165a","codename":"java_packages_rewrite"},"elements":{"title":{"value":"Java for Kontent by Kentico"},"url_slug":{"value":"java-for-kontent-by-kentico"},"release_date":{"value":"2022-05-06T00:00:00Z"},"image":{"value":[{"url":"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/6aec6c2a-3010-01c9-8295-4d988333f15d/f7b74fa4-a680-447b-8104-bad9ab5e7033/kontent-java-packages.png"}]},"summary":{"value":"<p>The monorepo containing Kontent Delivery SDK for data fetching facilitation from <a href=\"https://kontent.ai/\" data-new-window=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kontent headless CMS</a>, model generator, and a set of examples of how to use these two tools using Gradle, Spring Boot, and Java + Kotlin android application.</p>"},"channel_purpose":{"value":[{"codename":"website"}]},"listing_category":{"value":[{"name":"Java","codename":"java"},{"name":"Kontent.ai","codename":"kontent_ai"}]}}},{"__typename":"kontent_item_project","system":{"id":"487179db-d8d9-537e-8355-cacbd8cd6570","codename":"kentico_github_io"},"elements":{"title":{"value":"kentico.github.io"},"url_slug":{"value":"kentico-github-io"},"release_date":{"value":"2018-09-10T00:00:00Z"},"image":{"value":[{"url":"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/6aec6c2a-3010-01c9-8295-4d988333f15d/74aa9fa1-7edf-4fc2-8bec-63ac6e7261a7/bg-001%5B1%5D.jpg"}]},"summary":{"value":"<p>Official site for GitHub Community in Kentico.</p>"},"channel_purpose":{"value":[{"codename":"website"}]},"listing_category":{"value":[]}}},{"__typename":"kontent_item_project","system":{"id":"41971ead-6564-5426-a346-54cce6be18